{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freak is a politically incorrect post-apocalyptic horror-comedy where the zombies aren\u2019t just dead... They\u2019re freak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has fallen to the <strong>Woke Plague</strong>. The culture war is over, and they won. Society collapsed into chaos, and almost everyone surrendered to their toxic agenda. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the last free survivors \u2014 immune to the plague, but hunted by it.<br> Your mission is simple: <strong>purge this infection, survive the nightmare, and fight to take back what\u2019s left of humanity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammo is scarce, resources are few, and every encounter can mean death.<br> You\u2019ll need to know when to stand your ground, when to run, and when to vanish into the shadows. Because in <i>Woke Day</i>, the enemy doesn\u2019t stop, doesn\u2019t think, and doesn\u2019t forgive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781440/extras/7f314b522f0dbc29090dc97087ee10e1.avif?t=1759360819\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A politically incorrect <strong>post-apocalyptic setting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor shooter</strong> gameplay with scarce resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies as relentless as zombies \u2014 but louder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy and absurd <strong>dark comedy horror</strong> atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices: fight, run, or die trying</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot counts. Every mistake costs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Woke Day</strong>, you\u2019re not just fighting for your life.<br>You\u2019re fighting for the right to stay human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPORTANT NOTE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I DO NOT GIVE KEYS TO CURATORS , UNLESS I KNOW THEM!\u00a0</strong><br><br><br><strong>Do not waste your time, emails from unknown curators are deleted without reading.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781440?t=1759360819","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781440?t=1759360819","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781440/79f33cb4b862b3fdd8647d783f74bf1e75abbced/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759360819","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781440/79f33cb4b862b3fdd8647d783f74bf1e75abbced/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759360819","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freak is a politically incorrect post-apocalyptic horror-comedy where the zombies aren\u2019t just dead... They\u2019re freak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has fallen to the <strong>Woke Plague</strong>. The culture war is over, and they won. Society collapsed into chaos, and almost everyone surrendered to their toxic agenda. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the last free survivors \u2014 immune to the plague, but hunted by it.<br> Your mission is simple: <strong>purge this infection, survive the nightmare, and fight to take back what\u2019s left of humanity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammo is scarce, resources are few, and every encounter can mean death.<br> You\u2019ll need to know when to stand your ground, when to run, and when to vanish into the shadows. Because in <i>Woke Day</i>, the enemy doesn\u2019t stop, doesn\u2019t think, and doesn\u2019t forgive.</p><p class=\"